  "body": "## Bug Fixes\r\n\r\n- Fixed LDAP/LDAP HA login failures caused by username case differences during existing-user checks, and aligned user matching and authentication source checks\r\n- Fixed asset tree pagination failures caused by inconsistent links behind HTTPS reverse proxies\r\n- Fixed connection token exchange errors that prevented SFTP file management from opening\r\n- Fixed inconsistent timezone settings between Celery and Core to prevent scheduled task timing discrepancies\r\n- Fixed operations continuing after Compose command generation failed, and improved error reporting and failure handling\r\n- Fixed Compose configuration path resolution failures and interrupted PostgreSQL upgrade recovery, ensuring the database and Redis are ready before restoring application services",
